title: Authorizations › Case page › Send to payer and review and sign
route: /authorizations/case/R-1042
intro: When the 'Send to payer' button is on or greyed out, what both header buttons do when clicked, and which New case draft they open. Nothing is sent from the case page: a clinician signs in New case.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: only five requests have a draft ready in New case (R-1042, I-2207, R-0988, R-1101, I-2262). Any other request gets a new draft pre-filled from the request, which opens at the Referral step. 'Open in review and sign' is always on, even for a request already with the payer.
---
screen cp "Case page\n'Send to payer' appears in the header, the Recommended actions side panel and the Draft tab"
decision d1 "Does the request already have a result (decided)?"
process r1 "Greyed out. Reason: 'Approved. Nothing is left to send.'\n(the result word comes from the request)"
decision d2 "Is it already with the payer?"
process r2 "Greyed out. Reason: 'Already with the payer. Navigator is tracking it.'"
decision d3 "Is it a denial?"
process r3 "Greyed out. Reason: 'This request was denied. Advocate owns the next step.'"
decision d4 "Do all four Integrity checks pass?"
process r4 "Greyed out. Reason: 'Integrity has 2 open checks. Apply the matching actions first.'"
process on "'Send to payer' is on\n'Sending opens review and sign. Nothing goes to the payer until a clinician signs.'"

group gChk "What keeps a check open"
  process k1 "'Every sentence matches the chart'\nopen after you edit the draft, until 'Re-check'"
  process k2 "'Payer criteria are covered'\nopen until its action is applied (e.g. 'Name the step-down provider')"
  process k3 "'Dates are consistent'\nopen until its action is applied (e.g. 'Settle the sertraline start date')"
  process k4 "'Identifiers are protected'\nalways passes in the demo"
endgroup
process dm "Dismissing the action does not clear its check\nThe dismiss dialog warns about this"

click b1 "Click 'Open in review and sign'\n(always on)"
click b2 "Click 'Send to payer'\n(only when on)"
process rp "Look for this request's draft in New case\nThe draft named like 'draft-r1042', or any draft with this case ID"
decision d5 "Does a draft exist?"
process mk "A draft is created and filled from the request\nPatient, payer, level of care, request type and reason"
decision d6 "Where does the draft stand?"
goto g1 "Continues in: New case › Agents work"
goto g2 "Continues in: New case › Review and sign"
goto g3 "Continues in: New case › Referral step"
process ns "Nothing has been sent\nA licensed clinician signs in New case"

cp --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| r1
d1 -->|No| d2
d2 -->|Yes| r2
d2 -->|No| d3
d3 -->|Yes| r3
d3 -->|No| d4
d4 -->|No| r4
d4 -->|Yes| on
r4 -.-> k1
r4 -.-> k2
r4 -.-> k3
r4 -.-> k4
k2 --> dm
k3 --> dm
cp --> b1
on --> b2
b1 --> rp
b2 --> rp
rp --> d5
d5 -->|No| mk --> g3
d5 -->|Yes| d6
d6 -->|Agents are still working, e.g. R-1042| g1
d6 -->|All four checks passed, e.g. R-0988| g2
rp -.-> ns
